      "en": "The first rule of **aria**: do not use it if an HTML element already does the job. `<button>` comes with keyboard, role and focus; `<div onclick>` comes with none. Use each **landmark** (`header`, `nav`, `main`, `footer`) so screen readers can jump between sections, and headings in order (h1 → h2 → h3)."
